def var sort-labelBROWSE-3   as character no-undo .
def var sort-clmnBROWSE-3    as handle    no-undo .
def var cur-clmnBROWSE-3     as handle    no-undo .
def var cur-clmn-locBROWSE-3 as integer   no-undo .
def var re-queryBROWSE-3     as logical   initial no no-undo .
on start-search, ctrl-o of BROWSE-3 in frame Dialog-Frame do:
   run sort-brBROWSE-3
     (input (if available tt_price-all
             then recid(tt_price-all)
